{"name":"Raven’s Banquet","hex":"#bb2255","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"raven","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Any of several, generally large, species of birds in the genus Corvus with lustrous black plumage; especially the common raven (Corvus corax).","A jet-black, often glossy, colour, like that of the plumage of a raven (etymology 1, noun sense 1)."]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Of the jet-black and often glossy colour of the plumage of a raven (etymology 1, noun sense 1)."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/raven"},{"term":"banquet","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A large celebratory meal; a feast.","A ceremonial dinner party for many people."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To participate in a banquet; to feast.","To have dessert after a feast."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/banquet"}],"entries":[{"title":"Banquet","blocks":[{"text":"A banquet is a formal dining party where a large number of people consume food together. Banquets are traditionally held to enhance the prestige of a host, or reinforce social bonds among joint contributors. Modern examples of these purposes include a charitable gathering, a ceremony, a festival or other celebratory events. They often involve speeches in honor of the topic or guest of honour."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bf/Monreale-cattedrale-mosaik-abendmahl.JPG/330px-Monreale-cattedrale-mosaik-abendmahl.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Banquet","wikidata":"Q626066"},{"title":"Raven","blocks":[{"text":"A raven is any of several large-bodied passerine bird species in the genus Corvus. These species do not form a single taxonomic group within the genus. There is no consistent distinction between crows and ravens; the two names are assigned to different species mainly by size."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/31/3782_Common_Raven_in_flight.jpg/330px-3782_Common_Raven_in_flight.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Raven","wikidata":"Q8335"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a4/Floris_Claesz._van_Dyck_001.jpg/500px-Floris_Claesz._van_Dyck_001.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a4/Floris_Claesz._van_Dyck_001.jpg/1280px-Floris_Claesz._van_Dyck_001.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a4/Floris_Claesz._van_Dyck_001.jpg/500px-Floris_Claesz._van_Dyck_001.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AFloris_Claesz._van_Dyck_001.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7b/Hellenistic_banquet_scene.jpg/250px-Hellenistic_banquet_scene.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7b/Hellenistic_banquet_scene.jpg/500px-Hellenistic_banquet_scene.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7b/Hellenistic_banquet_scene.jpg/250px-Hellenistic_banquet_scene.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AHellenistic_banquet_scene.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3a/A_banquet_for_Babur.jpg/250px-A_banquet_for_Babur.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3a/A_banquet_for_Babur.jpg/250px-A_banquet_for_Babur.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&u